<%#
  "Participants from a file", the whole of it, in one card.

  Three states, decided in this order:

    review  a file has just been uploaded and read. What it holds, what we
            made of its columns, who its voters will say they are, and one
            button to take it.
    list    a list is imported. Who is on it, how they are identified, and
            how to replace or remove it.
    empty   no list yet: somewhere to drop the file.

  Every form here is the card's own, which is why the card sits outside the
  tab's form: HTML has no nested forms. The tab's Save is a separate button
  tied back to that form by `form:`, so the two never collide.

  Locals: `chosen`. `mapping_form`, `identifiers_form`, `import_outcome` and
  `census_voters_count` come from `CensusTabData`.
%>
<% scope = "decidim.elections.vocdoni.admin.census_setup.file" %>
<% shown = chosen == "token_csv" %>
<%
  review = mapping_form if mapping_form&.reader.present?
  # The real count, not the figure stored at import time, which goes stale.
  people_count = census_voters_count
  # This engine's own routes only resolve inside upstream's admin engine;
  # the proxy builds them from the component wherever this renders.
  admin = Decidim::EngineRouter.admin_proxy(election.component)
  upload_url = admin.election_census_file_path(election)
  editable = election.editable?
%>
<div class="card vocdoni-census__card vocdoni-census-file"
     data-census-block="token_csv"
     <%= "hidden" unless shown %>>
  <div class="card-divider">
    <h2 class="card-title">
      <%= review ? review.file&.filename.to_s.presence || t("legend", scope:) : t("legend", scope:) %>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="card-section">
    <div class="row column">
      <% if review %>
        <%= render "decidim/elections/vocdoni/admin/census_setup/file_review",
                   form: review, outcome: import_outcome, upload_url:, people_count:, scope: %>
      <% elsif people_count.positive? %>
        <%= render "decidim/elections/vocdoni/admin/census_setup/file_list",
                   people_count:, upload_url:, admin:, editable:, scope: %>
      <% else %>
        <%= render "decidim/elections/vocdoni/admin/census_setup/file_empty",
                   upload_url:, admin:, editable:, scope: %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
